1
00:00:00,966 --> 00:00:03,200
You can keep it now too

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,966
You also told me not to sleep back then

3
00:00:11,966 --> 00:00:12,766
Yeah

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,633
I'll keep that in mind then

5
00:00:17,366 --> 00:00:20,066
I won't lose it this time

6
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:32,000
Su Mingyao why didn't you tell me earlier

7
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,800
I didn't know how to say it

8
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,200
You could have told me at the wedding banquet

9
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,833
You could have said it the day of the fashion line release

10
00:00:40,966 --> 00:00:42,200
But I didn't want to say it like that

11
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,966
I could prove I was the one who signed it

12
00:00:43,966 --> 00:00:44,866
And prove that the old item

13
00:00:44,866 --> 00:00:46,000
Has always been in my box

14
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,066
But I didn't want to put myself

15
00:00:47,066 --> 00:00:48,433
In the position of your savior

16
00:00:48,666 --> 00:00:50,633
I didn't want you to choose me out of gratitude

17
00:00:50,966 --> 00:00:52,366
If you treat me well

18
00:00:52,666 --> 00:00:54,366
I hope it's because you want to

19
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,366
Not because you feel you owe me

20
00:00:56,966 --> 00:00:57,766
Su Mengyao

21
00:00:58,433 --> 00:00:59,866
I'm treating you well now
